{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52425","headline":"回波乐 六十八 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 六十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我本野外夫，不能恒礼则。\n爲性重任真，吃着随所得。\n既与万物齐，方（项校「於」）□（张锡厚拨补「中」字）守静默。\n一身逢太平，五内无六贼。\n（见斯四二七七卷，转录自《中华文史论丛》一九八四年第二辑刊张锡厚《斯四二七七残卷考释》。\n）（按：斯四二七七卷，原无作者名。\n张锡厚初拟题爲梵志体诗。\n後经与苏藏列一四五六卷重新缀合，确定此卷亦应爲王梵志诗，今从其说收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}